### Test Resubmit with different statuses
### First, login to get token
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nodal@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Test resubmit with DRAFT status (should work now)
POST http://localhost:3000/submission/resubmit/9e331272-e14d-431f-a990-92fce7df27fc
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "comment": "Testing resubmit with DRAFT status"
}

### Test resubmit with SUBMITTED_TO_STATE status (should work now)
POST http://localhost:3000/submission/resubmit/9e331272-e14d-431f-a990-92fce7df27fc
